Q: How to insert dots as thousands separators and a comma as the decimal separator on a number A: <p>Are you sure your $row['anskaf_sum'] does not hold some value you are not expecting?
Because:</p>

<pre><code>&lt;?php
        $number = 100000.5;
        echo number_format($number, 1, ",", ".");
?&gt;
</code></pre>

<p>... this returns exactly what you want: 100.000,5</p>
